#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:8
msgid "How to run, configure, and implement a Satellite app that speaks SAP."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:9
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deployment modes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:12
msgid "Hub learns about Satellites in two ways:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:13
#, no-wrap
msgid "Managed (config + systemd)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:16
#, no-wrap
msgid "Declare a process in `~/.anima/config.yaml`. `anima service start/stop/restart` writes `anima-satellite-<name>.service` user units (when systemd is available) and starts/stops them with `anima.service`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (yaml)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:17
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"satellites:\n"
"  companion:\n"
"    enabled: true\n"
"    command: bun\n"
"    args: [\"src/satellites/companion/dev.ts\"]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:26
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Chat / Task / Console** etc. are bundled in shell-ui (desktop / mobile / web); no separate `satellites:` dev process needed; browser local debug: `bun run dev:web`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:31
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Field              | Role                                             |\n"
"| ------------------ | ------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| `command` / `args` | Process to run (required for managed satellites) |\n"
"| `env`              | Extra environment variables                      |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:33
msgid ""
"Working directory is derived by anima from the install layout (monorepo root "
"or CLI package root), not configured here."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:35
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Startup:** managed satellites start only after Hub `GET /hub/rpc/v1/health/probe` returns `status: ok`.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:37
msgid ""
"See [service.md](../guide/service.md) for systemd unit paths and startup "
"order."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:38
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic (SAP connect)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:41
msgid ""
"No `command` in config. Start the satellite yourself; it connects to Hub via "
"SAP WebSocket. Instances appear on Console → Satellites after connect."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:43
msgid "There is **no** global `studio:` section in `config.yaml`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:45
msgid ""
"Open managed satellite UI at the URL from Console (SAP `http_url`), "
"typically the companion sidecar HTTP port."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:47
msgid ""
"Shell satellites (Chat, Console, etc.) open in desktop / mobile / web shell "
"routes; no dedicated port."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:48
#, no-wrap
msgid "Instance allocation strategies"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:51
msgid ""
"`instance_id` is a 3-character lowercase alphanumeric id (see [`src/shared/"
"sap-contract/naming.ts`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/naming.ts)). It "
"appears in platform strings (`sap:{app_slug}:{instance_id}`), session "
"`platform_extra`, and SAP tool names. **Do not remove it from the protocol** "
"— but each satellite app picks an **allocation strategy** suited to its "
"product model:"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:56
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Strategy      | Meaning                                | Apps             | Client behavior                                                            |\n"
"| ------------- | -------------------------------------- | ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| **singleton** | One fixed id per Hub for the whole app | **Chat** (`def`) | Always send `instance_id` on `connect`; Hub auto-provisions if missing     |\n"
"| **machine**   | One id per physical device / install   | **Companion**    | Omit `instance_id` on first connect; Hub assigns randomly; persist locally |\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:57
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph policies [Allocation strategies]\n"
"    Singleton[\"singleton: chat → def\"]\n"
"    Machine[\"machine: companion → per machine\"]\n"
"  end\n"
"  Singleton --> Platform1[\"platform = sap:chat:def\"]\n"
"  Machine --> Platform2[\"platform = sap:companion:{machineId}\"]\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:68
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Chat (singleton):** all desktop / mobile clients share `CHAT_INSTANCE_ID` (`def`) so `conversation.list` is unified across devices. Chat registers no satellite tools; multiple devices may connect with the same id (Console shows the last `http_url`).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:70
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Companion (machine):** `~/.anima/companion/instance.json` — one id per computer.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:72
msgid ""
"Hub [`SapInstanceRegistry`](../../src/platform/sap/instance-registry.ts): "
"omit `instance_id` → random allocation; send known id → reconnect or **auto-"
"provision** if the id is valid and unused."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:73
#, no-wrap
msgid "Satellite access modes"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:76
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Rule:** each `app_id + instance_id` has **at most one** active entry in `SatelliteManager` (last connect wins). Multiple WebSockets with the same id are not rejected but stream events follow each socket's own context.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:77
#, no-wrap
msgid "Type B + tools, no relay (companion)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:82
msgid ""
"Sidecar `createSatelliteHub({ relay: false, tools: [...] })` holds the sole "
"Hub WS."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:82
msgid ""
"Browser talks to sidecar HTTP only (no SAP relay); tools execute in sidecar "
"(`bubble`, `play_slot`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:82
msgid ""
"`instance_id` in `~/.anima/companion/instance.json`; platform `sap:companion:"
"{id}`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Fenced code block (mermaid)
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:83
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"flowchart TB\n"
"  subgraph companion [Companion Type B]\n"
"    B[Browser] --> SidecarHTTP[sidecar HTTP]\n"
"    SidecarHTTP --> ProcSAP[createSatelliteHub]\n"
"    ProcSAP -->|single SAP WS| Hub[Hub]\n"
"    ProcSAP --> ToolExec[tool executor]\n"
"  end\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:94
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Deprecated:** HTTP hub-api REST→SAP proxy (removed).\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:95
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bundled Hub RPC — shell modules (chat, task, notification, …)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:100
msgid ""
"Modules use shared [`getBundledHubRpcClient`](../../src/shared/hub-rpc/"
"bundled.ts) / [`getBundledSapStreamClient`](../../src/shared/sap-contract/"
"bundled-sap-stream.ts) on `/hub/rpc/v1`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:100
msgid "**No** `sap.attach`; **no** relay sidecar for these modules."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:100
msgid ""
"See [`hub-rpc.md`](hub-rpc.md) and [`frontend-exports.md`](frontend-"
"exports.md)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ###
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:101
#, no-wrap
msgid "Chat (bundled feature)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:105
msgid ""
"**Shell / browser dev (recommended)**: `getBundledSapStreamClient` on shared "
"Hub RPC; UI from [`src/features/chat/ui/spa/`](../../src/features/chat/ui/"
"spa/) embedded in shell-ui (no SAP relay, no `sap.attach`)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:105
msgid ""
"Hub RPC handlers: [`src/features/chat/hub/routes/index.ts`](../../src/"
"features/chat/hub/routes/index.ts); wire types: [`src/features/chat/protocol/"
"`](../../src/features/chat/protocol/) → `@freeanima/sap-contract/feature-"
"rpc`."
msgstr ""

