"code."
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:155
#, no-wrap
msgid "Console visibility"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/sap/satellite-guide.md:158
msgid ""
"`hub().call(\"src/satellites.status\")` (REST `GET /hub/rpc/v1/src/"
"satellites/status`; Console → Satellites) reads "
"`SatelliteManager.getStatus()`: connected instances, `http_url`, registered "
"tools, heartbeat timestamps."
msgstr ""

